{"id":157,"date":"2025-10-20T05:06:50","date_gmt":"2025-10-20T05:06:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/agderit.wpenginepowered.com\/?page_id=157"},"modified":"2026-08-13T06:57:00","modified_gmt":"2026-08-13T06:57:00","slug":"om-oss","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/agderit.no\/om-oss\/","title":{"rendered":"Om oss"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"157\" class=\"elementor elementor-157\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e550b50 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e550b50\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d3668d1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d3668d1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e0b0ada elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e0b0ada\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Agder IT<\/h1>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e3a5cda elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e3a5cda\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Din IT leverand\u00f8r i Kristiansand<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d8318db elementor-widget elementor-widget-breadcrumbs\" data-id=\"d8318db\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"breadcrumbs.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p id=\"breadcrumbs\"><span><span><a href=\"https:\/\/agderit.no\/\">Hjem<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fe750a2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"fe750a2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-152b522 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"152b522\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0acc23c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0acc23c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tV\u00e5r garanti\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e2e7e5f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e2e7e5f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Som kunde hos oss<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f21f1e3 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f21f1e3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:400}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tVi forst\u00e5r viktigheten av \u00e5 skille seg ut i dagens konkurransedyktige marked. Agder IT AS tilbyr IT tjenester for et bredt spekter av sm\u00e5 og mellomstore bedrifter. Vi er ekstra opptatt av service og rask respons. Hos oss trenger du ikke ringe til en support-avdeling, du ringer i stedet direkte til din faste IT konsulent for rask og effektiv probleml\u00f8sning n\u00e5r det trengs.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0590042 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child\" data-id=\"0590042\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-96aa8cc elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"96aa8cc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tProfesjonell ekspertise\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tDra nytte av v\u00e5r dyptg\u00e5ende kompetanse og erfaring innen IT. V\u00e5rt dedikerte team av eksperter jobber hardt for \u00e5 levere l\u00f8sninger av h\u00f8y kvalitet som oppfyller dine behov.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2019e6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"a2019e6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tP\u00e5litelig samarbeid\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tV\u00e5re forn\u00f8yde kunder har oppdaget at de kan stole p\u00e5 oss som en p\u00e5litelig samarbeidspartner. Vi setter dine interesser f\u00f8rst og strekker oss langt for \u00e5 sikre at du oppn\u00e5r de \u00f8nskede resultatene.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f3dfe7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"0f3dfe7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSkreddersydde l\u00f8sninger\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-icon-box-description\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tVi g\u00e5r gjennom bedriftens behov og setter opp en l\u00f8sning som passer for dere. Ta kontakt for en uforpliktende, kostnadsfri konsultasjon.\t\t\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ba11b48 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ba11b48\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-11fd4a9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"11fd4a9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dc46d8e animated-slow elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"dc46d8e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/agderit.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/643608b7c6fc9e78819d5e5d_Blog-4-1.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-113\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e534ae5 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e534ae5\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e38619b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e38619b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAgder IT\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d26fffa elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d26fffa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Bli litt bedre kjent med oss<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7023ce8 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7023ce8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:400}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"bodytext\">Med betydelig erfaring siden 2009, har vi mange \u00e5r innen bransjen. Vi har betjent Kristiansand og omegn med stolthet.<\/p><p class=\"bodytext\">Vi g\u00e5r utover \u00e5 v\u00e6re kun tjenesteleverand\u00f8r, og fungerer som en p\u00e5litelig partner for v\u00e5re kunder. V\u00e5rt dedikerte team av eksperter jobber hardt for \u00e5 sikre at hver oppgave blir utf\u00f8rt med den h\u00f8yeste standarden og n\u00f8yaktighet.<\/p><p class=\"bodytext\">Vi strekker oss alltid etter \u00e5 levere det beste for v\u00e5re kunder, og dette gjenspeiles i hvert prosjekt vi tar p\u00e5 oss. Gjennom \u00e5rene har vi etablert et rykte for kvalitet, p\u00e5litelighet og enest\u00e5ende kundeservice. V\u00e5rt engasjement for \u00e5 overg\u00e5 forventningene har gjort oss til et naturlig valg for de som s\u00f8ker ekspertise og dedikasjon i innen v\u00e5rt felt.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c3c0c1c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c3c0c1c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fdc7d33 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"fdc7d33\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9d64e34 animated-slow elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"9d64e34\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/agderit.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/643608dfc6fc9e729e9d6261_Blog-5-1.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-114\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9b7f27f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9b7f27f\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-41fa0c8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"41fa0c8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMed kunden i fokus\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-23fea1f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"23fea1f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Hva vi leverer<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d0b8b96 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d0b8b96\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:400}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"18\" data-end=\"166\">Vi gj\u00f8r IT enkelt og trygt for sm\u00e5 og mellomstore bedrifter. M\u00e5let er at du skal f\u00e5 l\u00f8sninger som fungerer i hverdagen, uten stress og teknisk prat.<\/p><p data-start=\"168\" data-end=\"304\">Hos oss f\u00e5r du en fast kontaktperson som kjenner bedriften din. N\u00e5r noe haster, ringer du direkte. Vi svarer raskt og finner en l\u00f8sning.<\/p><p data-start=\"306\" data-end=\"471\">Vi planlegger, setter opp og drifter det du trenger, og f\u00f8lger opp jevnlig. Vi tenker langsiktig, slik at systemene dine er stabile, sikre og klare for videre vekst.<\/p><p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"631\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Vi holder til i Kristiansand og hjelper kunder i hele regionen. Vil du ha en ryddig og tilgjengelig IT-partner som gj\u00f8r ting ordentlig? Da er du p\u00e5 rett sted.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4156f84 elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"4156f84\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"https:\/\/agderit.no\/kontakt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Sp\u00f8rsm\u00e5l? Ta kontakt<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51a9cd2 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"51a9cd2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8e24aa1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"8e24aa1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-487b492 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"487b492\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTilbakemeldinger\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c98df21 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"c98df21\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Hyggelige ord fra v\u00e5re kunder<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-095606c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"095606c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-20d0980 elementor-testimonial--align-left elementor-pagination-type-fraction elementor-testimonial--mobile-align-left elementor-testimonial--skin-default elementor-testimonial--layout-image_inline elementor-widget elementor-widget-testimonial-carousel\" data-id=\"20d0980\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" id=\"testimonials-slider\" data-settings=\"{&quot;slides_per_view&quot;:&quot;2&quot;,&quot;pagination&quot;:&quot;fraction&quot;,&quot;space_between&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:50,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;lazyload&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;slides_per_view_mobile&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;slides_to_scroll&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;speed&quot;:500,&quot;loop&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;space_between_tablet&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]},&quot;space_between_mobile&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;px&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:10,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}\" data-widget_type=\"testimonial-carousel.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-main-swiper swiper\" role=\"region\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\" aria-label=\"Slides\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__text\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\u201cVi er veldig forn\u00f8yde med supporten til Agder IT AS, rask respons p\u00e5 b\u00e5de telefon og e-post n\u00e5r vi trenger hjelp. De har driftet v\u00e5rt IT-system i over 10 \u00e5r, og l\u00f8st alle utfordringer p\u00e5 en utmerket m\u00e5te.\u05f4\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial__image\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img class=\"swiper-lazy\" data-src=\"https:\/\/agderit.no\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/icons8-quote-100.png\" alt=\"Eksepsjonell service!\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-lazy-preloader\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<cite class=\"elementor-testimonial__cite\"><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__name\">Eksepsjonell service!<\/span><span class=\"elementor-testimonial__title\">Eier\/Daglig Leder Jan Buch - Halvard Thorsen AS<\/span><\/cite>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"swiper-slide\" role=\"group\" aria-roledescription=\"slide\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-testimonial\">